# Inventory Stock Level Audit Dashboard

## Project Overview
This Excel dashboard provides inventory stock analysis across different warehouses and product categories.

## Features
- Total Inventory Value Tracking
- Warehouse-wise Inventory Analysis
- Product-wise Inventory Value
- Stock Status Distribution
- Top Products Analysis
- Interactive Pivot Tables & Charts

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Conditional Formatting
- Dashboard Design

